OL,3,CUlster-Scots tradition celebrated at
OL,4,Cshow in Fleadh first
OL,6,FPeople have lined the Titanic slipways
OL,7,Fto watch one the most talked about
OL,8,Fcross-community events of the All-
OL,9,FIreland Fleadh.
OL,11,FMarching bands from all over Northen
OL,12,FIreland played as highland dancers
OL,13,Ftook centre stage to the sound of
OL,14,Fflutes and lambeg drums celebrating
OL,15,Fthe history of the Ulster-Scots
OL,16,Ftradition.
