OL,3,CUlster-Scots tradition celebrated at
OL,4,Cshow in Fleadh first
OL,6,FThe show is a Fleadh first, and was
OL,7,Fdescribed as new territory by the
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland bands Forum, who said
OL,9,Ftaking part gives their culture a
OL,10,Fplatform.
